 rounds:R,end:['Frequent self-evaluation lifts outcomes with any goal,','and monitoring progress helps, whoever does the recording.'],
 endOut:`<b>🏁 Progress feedback</b> can substantiate self-efficacy and motivation, especially on tasks where progress is slow or standards unclear. As learners become more skilful, they become better at evaluating their own progress. Bars show the order only (illustrative heights).`,
